{"availability":"available","full":"bkuan001/halo-record","name":"halo-record","description":"Tamper-evident audit trails for AI agents: hash-chained Runtime Records, dependency-free, verifiable by anyone.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":84,"forks":10,"created":"2026-06-11T20:15:31Z","updated":"2026-10-03T19:08:13Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pypi.org/project/halo-record/","topics":["agents","ai-agents","ai-governance","ai-security","attestation","audit-log","audit-trail","compliance","llm","mcp","opentelemetry","python","security","tamper-evident"],"demo":"https://docs.astral.sh/uv/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T05:02:14.022Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T05:02:14.022Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T05:02:14.022Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:42.358Z","stars":84,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:40.414Z","stars":84,"forks":11},{"at":"2026-10-19T05:02:14.022Z","stars":84,"forks":10}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tamper-evident audit trails for AI agents — hash-chained Runtime Records, rendered as a Runtime Report your customers can check themselves.","Every action your instrumentation captures (tool calls, model calls, data access, approvals) becomes one Runtime Record in an append-only, hash-chained log; the Runtime Report is that chain rendered as an HTML page that re-computes the hash chain in the reader's browser and renders what it displays from the records it verified (for a check that does not rely on the page's own code, run halo verify on the JSONL). Any party holding a checkpoint of the chain can verify that the records up to that checkpoint have not been altered since it was taken, without trusting whoever produced them — that…","The record format is open and free to implement. This package is the reference implementation: recorder, verifier, witness client, and report server."],"features":[],"sourceUr